    <string name="login_cookie_howto">If Google refuses the app\'s window, sign in to music.youtube.com in a normal desktop browser and copy the Cookie header:\n\n1. Open music.youtube.com already signed in to your account\n2. F12 → Network tab → reload the page\n3. Click any request to music.youtube.com\n4. Under Request Headers find the Cookie line and copy all of it\n5. Paste it here\n\nThat line is the key to your account. It is stored on the phone only and goes nowhere except YouTube\'s servers.</string>
    <string name="login_google_blocked">If Google says "this browser isn\'t secure", tap COOKIE above — there\'s a way around it there.</string>
